<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title="Terms — Paisa Inbox" description="Terms for using the Paisa Inbox financial inbox." /></head><body><main class="legal-page"><a href="/">← Back to Paisa Inbox</a><span class="eyebrow">TERMS</span><h1>A clearer view, not financial advice.</h1><p class="lead">Paisa Inbox helps organize and explain transaction information. It is not a bank, payment service, accountant, tax adviser, or investment adviser.</p><h2>Your responsibility</h2><p>You are responsible for verifying imported transactions, classifications, reimbursements, and summaries before relying on them.</p><h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>Use Paisa Inbox only with accounts and financial records you are authorized to access. Do not attempt to access another user’s data or disrupt the service.</p><h2>Availability</h2><p>Beta features may change and automated classifications can be incomplete. Keep original bank records as the authoritative source.</p><h2>Ending use</h2><p>You may export or delete your data at any time from Preferences.</p><p class="legal-note">Last updated: 2 August 2026. Commercial launch terms require review after the operating entity, providers, and supported regions are finalized.</p></main></body></html>
